# Benchmark measurement evidence (large raw artifacts, kept on disk only)
benchmark/runs/

# Raw measurement data (jsonl): per-run probe/instrumentation records, kept on
# disk only. They are machine-generated, large, and may carry environment
# specifics (internal host addresses) that should not enter version control.
# Analysis conclusions belong in the markdown reports instead.
*.jsonl

